OL,3,GNEWSASessions highlight pets' role in
OL,4,Adomestic abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople who work with animals are being
OL,7,Finvited to attend awareness sessions
OL,8,Fhighlighting how pets can be used by
OL,9,Fdomestic abusers to control and
OL,10,Fmanipulate victims.
OL,12,FThe online sessions, run by East Riding
OL,13,Fof Yorkshire Council's domestic
OL,14,Fviolence and abuse partnership team and
OL,15,Fthe RSPCA, are aimed at professionals
OL,16,Fincluding vets, groomers and pet care
OL,17,Fworkers.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
