OL,1,W5j 5Quzj#5w;jp%p05 jj#57+
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASessions highlight pets' role in
OL,4,Adomestic abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe training, which is part of Domestic
OL,7,FAbuse Awareness Month, aims to help
OL,8,Fattendees spot signs of abuse and
OL,9,Funderstand how perpetrators can use
OL,10,Fthreats, harm or neglect of pets to
OL,11,Fexert control over victims.
OL,13,FIt will also provide advice on
OL,14,Frecognising warning signs and directing
OL,15,Fpeople to specialist support.
